  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "A cell, shunted by a <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math>&nbsp;resistance, is balanced across a potentiometer wire of length <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>. The balancing length is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> when the cell is shunted by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math> resistance. The value of internal resistance of the cell will be _____&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi><mo>.</mo></math>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "8",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/89bc3bfc-5ce5-4d4b-a8e4-75cdadfed44c-image.png\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 161px;\" /></p><p>Potential difference across test battery is,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8733;</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8733;</mo><mi>l</mi></math></p><p>Therefore, we can write,&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mfenced><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>r</mi></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math></p>",
